  "abstract": "This submission is a precise replication of Ariadne I's new global SOTA model, \"FF-LN LearnableGamma (p=36,H=160,drop=0.05) \u2014 Internal \u03b3, Adam lr=9e-4, Clip=1.0\" (ID 450, score -0.026125). It fully incorporates the updated `FourierForecasterLN_Ramp` architecture from `storage/ariadne/models_fourier_ramp.py`, including the crucial learnable `gamma` ramp logic. All hyperparameters, including `proj_rank=36`, `mlp_hidden_size=160x2`, `dropout_rate=0.05`, `learning_rate=9e-4`, and `optax.adam(eps=1e-8)` with gradient clipping, are precisely matched. This aims to accurately reproduce the global SOTA and establish a new lineage baseline. This run benefits from the new 60-minute trial timeout.",
